# Work Stamina fill over a pasture panel row. The code crops it to the stamina and tints it green, yellow or red.
size 48 2
palette
  w #ffffff     fill, top: the tint itself
  g #c2c2c2     fill, bottom: a darker tint
pixels
wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww
gggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggg
